{"id":21009,"artist":"Come What May","title":"Nicole Kidman and Ewan Mc Gregor","lyrics_plain":null,"lyrics_synced":"[00:00.00] Generated by NoteWorthy Composer\n[00:32.55] Never knew I could feel like this\n[00:39.81] Like I've never seen the sky before\n[00:47.17] I want to vanish inside your kiss\n[00:54.03] Every day I'm loving you more and more\n[01:00.48] Listen to my heart, can you hear it sing\n[01:07.74] Telling me to give you everything\n[01:15.06] Seasons may change, winter to spring\n[01:25.59] But I love you until the end of time\n[01:35.19] Come what may\n[01:42.18] Come what may\n[01:49.21] I will love you until my dying day\n[02:06.26] Suddenly the world seems such a perfect place\n[02:13.45] Suddenly it moves with such a perfect grace\n[02:20.32] Suddenly my life doesn't seem such a waste\n[02:27.92] It all revolves around you\n[02:33.19] And there's no mountain too high\n[02:37.83] No river too wide\n[02:42.40] Sing out this song and I'll be there by your side\n[02:49.78] Storm clouds may gather\n[02:52.53] And stars may collide\n[02:59.88] But I love you (I love you) until the end of time\n[03:05.84] (end of time)\n[03:09.28] Come what may\n[03:16.35] Come what may\n[03:23.35] I will love you until my dying day\n[03:33.01] Oh, come what may, come what may\n[03:47.85] I will love you, I will love you\n[03:57.86] Suddenly the world seems such a perfect place\n[04:10.63] Come what may\n[04:18.53] Come what may\n[04:26.40] I will love you until my dying day\n","lyrics_synced_enhanced":"[00:32.54] <00:32.54>Nev <00:32.77>er <00:32.99>knew <00:34.33>I <00:34.56>could <00:34.78>feel <00:36.11>like <00:36.56>this\n[00:39.80] <00:39.80>Like <00:40.05>I've <00:40.71>nev <00:40.91>er <00:41.11>se <00:41.34>en <00:41.56>the <00:41.78>sky <00:43.46>b <00:43.70>e <00:43.95>fore\n[00:47.16] <00:47.16>I <00:47.39>want <00:47.62>to <00:48.05>vanish <00:48.97>in <00:49.46>side <00:50.79>your <00:51.24>kiss\n[00:54.02] <00:54.02>Ever <00:54.48>y <00:54.70>day <00:55